# Playwright storageState: a REAL signed-in admin session, reusable as a
# credential by anyone who obtains the file. It was untracked but unignored,
# i.e. one `git add .` from being committed to a repo history that cannot be
# rewritten. Flagged by an independent live QA 2026-07-18.
.auth/

# Local scratch produced by QA/debug runs — never part of the app.
scratchpad/
